## The Dead

@narrator: Not everyone gets up.
@narrator{when="holds(fell(isolde))"}: Isolde Vane lies where she chose to stand, in front of the wagons, sword still out. She kept her oath. It cost exactly what she said it would.
@narrator{when="holds(fell(corvin))"}: Corvin is sitting against a wheel as if he stopped for a rest. His purse is still on his belt. That is how you know.
@narrator{when="holds(fell(wren))"}: Wren went down at the edge of the gorge, and the river came up to meet her. It did not give her back.
